            "notes": "Round 1 Power: [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) is potentially not the strongest power for this round but it will allow us to get more cash and set us up for the combo of pairing it with [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) on round 3 for a ridiculous combo that provides Zenyatta with unmatched 1v1 potential and cash generation. \n\nWe take ability power this round after the [Orb of Harmony](ability_8f354f72-fe40-43b4-8231-aac9c0523c0d) buffs because it helps with cash generation. If you get a free 1k slot after weapon power in other rounds it is worth a buy.\n\nThe interaction between [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) and [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) is bugged currently and only provides the self healing while the target you are shooting is discorded but it is still a very important part of this build. The healing to a team mate applies without the discord. I have submitted bug reports with videos since stadium season 1 but no change yet.",
