            "created_at": "2025-10-03T08:34:31.626745+00:00",
            "notes": "This round we pick up the scary combo of [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e). These two are must buy items on round 2 with Zenyatta because of the synergy with [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) and [Orb of Harmony](ability_8f354f72-fe40-43b4-8231-aac9c0523c0d). Whenever you or the team mate you harmony take damage you get 10% [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and overall 20% [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) from two items. Mathematically this gives you 32% more damage for 10k cash which you can not beat. \n\nIf you have 12k or more and can purchase [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) then that will come to 43.75% more damage.",
