            "created_at": "2025-10-03T08:34:31.626745+00:00",
            "notes": "Here is your power spike round. You now have the combo of [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) and [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) meaning that all damage you deal heals you and a team mate for 35% of the damage you deal. This is better than weapon lifesteal as it counts towards stadium cash. You should be very hard to beat 1v1 if you play for cover. \n\nYou will also pick up 100% projectile speed with [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3). This allows you to play at a greater range than what you normally would with Zen and will allow you to hit lots of shots that the enemy won't expect (especially on airborne targets). He is not hitscan with this speed but it is faster than any other projectile hero in the game. \n\nIn terms of damage output you are %56.25 more damage but this round you get much higher combat effectiveness due to higher projectile speed and 35% pseudo [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) to you and a team mate. This round on typically I am top healing in the lobby.",
