            "notes": "This round you should consider buying some survivability in [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) which reduced ability damage taken if they are ability heavy damage (Soldier [Double Helix](item_808afc07-1398-4962-bf2c-f8e3b74014e3) build, etc.). This synergises well with your big shield health pool but only necessary if you are dying often to ability damage.\n\nIf you have enough for filler greens [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) or [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) are good.",
