            "created_at": "2025-10-03T08:34:31.626745+00:00",
            "notes": "This round choose [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44). I believe [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) is the better option 95% of the time with the other considerations being [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) or [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62). \n\nThe reason why you go [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) is mainly the manoeuvrability and survivability. At this point in the game the enemy team will be trying their very best to dive you. Play cover and don't be afraid to take the 1v1. If it is a multi-person dive reposition with flying kick and try to isolate one person for the 1v1. Your [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) will do a lot of damage because it scales with weapon damage but please do not try and frontline with it. It is a tool and an orb to the face will do more.",
